<WORKSPACE_STRUCTURE>
The data is in `/Users/hrishioa/Dropbox/Projects/Southbridge/experiments/sealed-agents/tests/healthcare-ehr-langton/data`. This is a read-only directory. The information in this directory is our primary, and only source for understanding.

